      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Turtles dig a hole in the sand and drop a hundred eggs. Turtles turn to the surf.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_055/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6922,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8411
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "At night the eggs hatch. The sand churns, and a hundred turtles burst out.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_055/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5773,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7758
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Turtles must find the surf. In the dark, the surf shines. Turtles run at that shine.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_055/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7131,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9168
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "But lamps shine more. Turtles turn to the lamps, run to the curb, and get hurt.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_055/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7575,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8646
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "In summer, turn off the porch lamps. Make sure it is dark. Turtles get to the surf.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_055/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_055/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7314,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
